1
00:00:06,545 --> 00:00:08,615
(Leonard:)How'd you get
ready so fast?

2
00:00:08,615 --> 00:00:10,085
(Penny:)Oh, I pack light.

3
00:00:10,083 --> 00:00:11,653
(Penny:)Once, I got through
an entire spring break

4
00:00:11,651 --> 00:00:13,821
(Penny:)with nothing
but a long T-shirt and a belt.

5
00:00:15,654 --> 00:00:16,924
(Leonard:)Why did you need a belt?

6
00:00:16,923 --> 00:00:19,893
(Penny:)It's called an
evening look.

7
00:00:19,893 --> 00:00:22,093
(Penny:)I've never been to
New Jersey before.

8
00:00:22,095 --> 00:00:24,165
(Leonard:)It gets a bad rap from shows

9
00:00:24,164 --> 00:00:26,134
like Jersey Shore
and Real Housewives.

10
00:00:26,133 --> 00:00:27,663
(Penny:)So it's not
really like that?

11
00:00:27,667 --> 00:00:29,737
(Leonard:)No, it's like that.

12
00:00:30,970 --> 00:00:32,670
(Leonard:)Well, I'm excited
to show you around.

13
00:00:32,672 --> 00:00:34,742
(Penny:)You think we'll have time
to visit your mom over there?

14
00:00:34,741 --> 00:00:37,811
(Leonard:)Yes. We'll also have time to put
my junk in a garlic press,

15
00:00:37,811 --> 00:00:40,311
(Leonard:)but I'm not
doing that either.

16
00:00:40,313 --> 00:00:43,013
(phone chimes)

17
00:00:43,016 --> 00:00:44,646
(Leonard:)Uh-oh.

18
00:00:44,651 --> 00:00:46,281
(Leonard:)I just got an alert.

19
00:00:46,286 --> 00:00:47,516
(Leonard:)Our flight's
been canceled.

20
00:00:47,521 --> 00:00:48,621
(Penny:)What?

21
00:00:48,622 --> 00:00:49,922
(Leonard:)Yeah, looks like
there's a big storm

22
00:00:49,923 --> 00:00:51,623
(Leonard:)all up the East Coast.

23
00:00:51,625 --> 00:00:53,425
(Penny:)Well, can we get
on another airline?

24
00:00:53,426 --> 00:00:54,826
(Leonard:)I don't think so.

25
00:00:54,828 --> 00:00:55,928
(Penny:)So, that's it?

26
00:00:55,929 --> 00:00:57,029
(Penny:)We're not going?

27
00:00:57,030 --> 00:00:59,360
(Leonard:)I guess not.
(scoffs)

28
00:00:59,366 --> 00:01:00,436
(Penny:)Well, that sucks.

29
00:01:00,433 --> 00:01:01,603
(Penny:)Yeah.

